  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening conservation and resilience of forest landscapes in the sub-humid mountainous zone of Togo (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will support the integrated, participatory management of sub-humid forests in Zone IV to conserve biodiversity, improve ecosystem functioning, increase carbon storage, and promote sustainable, productive and climate-resilient livelihoods for forest-dependant women and men.</narrative>
